      "comment": "PAW GERTRUDE (5) was rewarded for her honesty after two minors on end with a deserved win last time, scoring at Warrnambool over 450m (25.49). Consistent performer from this draw with a win and eight minor placings to her credit. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. RATTLER (4) jumped from the inside and boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten 1.4 lengths (30.45) behind Trendy Art at this track. Hard to beat again. TRENDY TOMMY (7) ran below best last time finishing fourth (30.49) over 525m at this track from Box 2. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Can figure in the finish. TASTE (2) is right in the mix.",
